			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760100201,
					"content": "Twenty-five... twenty-six...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100202,
					"content": "Hmm? What are you counting?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100203,
					"content": "Shhh! Keep it down... Ah, forget it. Not like I was gonna catch anything anyway.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100204,
					"content": "Come on, kid, isn't it obvious? I'm timing my cast. What, did you think I was waving this rod around to cast spells or something?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100205,
						760100207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100205,
					"content": "Well... you are a member of the Frostmoon Scions, so maybe it's not that far off base...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100206
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760100206,
					"content": "#Haha, you're giving me too much credit, {M#young man}{F#young lady}. I'm barely half a Frostmoon Scion. Not even an acolyte. Just a regular guy with no kuuvahki power to speak of.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100210,
					"content": "Anyway, this is the first time Paimon's seen someone time their fishing down to the second...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100211,
					"content": "Well, what matters is your fishing technique, not how long you stand on the shore. Old Ilmari never got that — no wonder he never caught anything.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100212,
					"content": "Hmm? So I take it you two must be treasure hunters?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100213,
					"content": "No, we're adventurers... But we do take on work. Do you need something?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100214,
					"content": "Pretty much. As long as you're up for getting paid to do a job, who you are is all the same to me. I've got something you could help with — if you've got time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100215,
					"content": "You see, I'm the best angler on Hiisi Island by a long shot. No one, not even successive generations of Moonchanters, could surpass me in fishing...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100216,
					"content": "Really? That's amazing... Wait, that doesn't mean anything! Fishing isn't even part of a Moonchanter's job!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100217,
					"content": "Still, even with all this skill, I haven't caught a single fish lately. Makes no sense, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100218,
					"content": "So obviously, the problem isn't with me, but with the environment. Just as it is with the cursed Eye of Kratti, there must be something underwater affecting the fish.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100219,
					"content": "Seems like quite the leap in logic...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100220,
					"content": "Anyway, I was hoping you two could check the nearby waters, see what's scaring the fish off. Don't worry, you'll be properly compensated for your efforts.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100221,
					"content": "Well, since there's a reward involved, we'll take a look around... but no promises we'll actually find anything weird, okay?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100207,
					"content": "Maybe you're catching a bestest travel companion... Who knows?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760100208,
					"content": "Huh...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100209,
					"content": "Hey! Don't make it sound like anyone can fish up their bestest travel companion with a casual cast! Wait... That's not even the point here!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
