						],
						"pointId": 12598
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760100601,
					"content": "Hey, did you see that? I don't even know what happened — one moment, I was looking away, and the next thing I knew, that big rock just flew off!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100602,
					"content": "You explain what happened earlier...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760100603,
					"content": "Oh my! I have no idea what any of that means, but if you can pull off something that amazing, you must have the Moon Ma{RUBY#[D]Kuutar}iden's favor!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100604,
					"content": "Oh, the Moon Goddess protects! She protects indeed! Now I can fish here to my heart's content — so long as that annoying bard doesn't bring his pet over or, Goddess forbid, start singing...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100605,
					"content": "As promised, here's your payment. Although I haven't caught any fish lately, I've reeled in all kinds of other stuff, some of which should be worth quite a bit...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760100606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				},
				{
					"id": 760100606,
					"content": "Not that Mora's much use around Hiisi Island anyway, so it's all yours. Thanks for your help — now, it's time to fish in peace!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Pekkani"
				}
			]
		}
	]
